	}

```

But the interpreter implementation just optimizes this part of the spec so that the gas for the access list processing will be reduced in size:

```
If the target is not in accessed_addresses, charge COLD_ACCOUNT_ACCESS_COST gas, and add the address to accessed_addresses.
Otherwise, charge WARM_STORAGE_READ_COST gas.
```

## Recommended Mitigation Steps

Make sure the Karakot implementation is fully compatible EIP-2929 as this EIP was introduced even before the London hardfork.


